+    "reduction_kind": "none",
+    "reduction": None,
+    "reduction_source": "paper_central",
+    "intuition_type": "invariant",
+    "intuition_description": (
+        "A complete-bipartite Cayley cluster has a connection set closed under "
+        "XOR after zero is adjoined; without recognizing that invariant, a solver "
+        "must search over additions and deletions of whole translation orbits."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: exhaustive five-generator basis decoding is an exact "
+        "O(C(31,5)*32) algorithm for the shipping representation and is measured "
+        "at about 4.9 million span/membership operations, whereas local XOR-support "
+        "recovery uses fewer than 300 exact operations once closure is recognized; the paper's "
+        "general forbidden-subgraph search is O(6^k+n+m) for expanded edit budget k."
