Hard was also solved 3/3, so it cannot ship as configured. The harness is now exercising the fixed-answer-length escalation path (`n` doubles while the 12-integer certificate stays fixed), exactly as required; I’m letting the script reach its own hardened, budget-bound, or too-easy verdict rather than tuning around this run.
