+    "intended_route_operations": 129,
+    "pass": true
+  },
+  "all_passed": true,
+  "shipping_difficulty": "hard",
+  "shipping_params": {
+    "errors": 6,
+    "n": 4096,
+    "subspace_dim": 4
+  },
+  "track": "B"
+}

codex
The `n=16,384` level ultimately had two solves and one failure, so escalation continues to `n=32,768` with the same 14-integer maximum answer. This confirms the fixed-length escalation works, but the family may end up script-classified as budget-bound if the remaining levels are still solved.
